00:18:45.980 --> 00:18:47.140
Mantieni un approccio snello

00:18:47.140 --> 00:18:48.520
o sprecherai tempo e budget.

00:18:49.200 --> 00:18:50.220
Sul versante delle licenze

00:18:50.220 --> 00:18:51.080
ricorda l'elaborazione

